 "frame_eqs_eel": "zoom = 1.045 + 0.07*bass_att;\nrot = 0.02*sin(time*0.21) + 0.015*(mid_att - 1);\nob_r = 0.5 + 0.5*sin(time*1.13);\nob_g = 0.5 + 0.5*sin(time*0.91 + 2.1);\nob_b = 0.5 + 0.5*sin(time*1.37 + 4.2);\nob_a = 0.35 + 0.5*min(bass, 1.5)/1.5;\nwave_r = 1 - ob_r; wave_g = 1 - ob_g; wave_b = 1 - ob_b;\nq1 = 0.05*sin(time*0.5);",
